        "titolo_orig": "Trump falls short in Georgia governor’s race: 5 takeaways from Tuesday’s primaries",
        "testo_it": "Sconfitta per Donald Trump in Georgia: il miliardario Rick Jackson vince le primarie repubblicane per il governatore.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 17,
        "link": "https://thehill.com/homenews/campaign/5927330-trump-georgia-alabama-dc-oklahoma-elections-takeaways/",
        "orario": "06:08",
        "timestamp": 1781669307,
        "contenuto_esteso": "Georgia Republicans dealt a blow to President Trump on Tuesday, bucking his preferred pick, Lt. Gov. Burt Jones (R), for healthcare executive and billionaire Rick Jackson in the Peach State’s gubernatorial primary. Jackson defeated Jones by single digits in the Republican gubernatorial runoff — marking the second time one of Trump’s endorsees in a major statewide..."
